<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram id="docgraph_v6" name="Layered KG workflow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1942" dy="875" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1720" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;b&gt;Building a layered knowledge graph and putting it to use — v6, all steps built (measured on the pilot against AI labels)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:13px'&gt;One command: &lt;i&gt;kg ingest --corpus DIR&lt;/i&gt; (first build) / &lt;i&gt;--event DIR --check --review&lt;/i&gt; (each upload); &lt;i&gt;kg doctor&lt;/i&gt; checks the setup. Local LLM (Qwen3.5-4B, Ollama); every relationship points back to its source block&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="1500" x="60" y="15" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L1" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="Part 1: Build the graph (whole store once, then only new files or changed blocks)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="370" width="1590" x="60" y="85" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="30" width="590" x="60" y="85" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Collect files and identify the document&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thai/English Markdown + path, source (OCR/digital), access rights&lt;br&gt;Which document: registry key → &lt;b&gt;text similarity&lt;/b&gt; (file name and title only break ties) → a person confirms (queue file, &lt;i&gt;kg confirm-queue&lt;/i&gt;)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="20" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Layer 0: Structure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Document → Version → root Section → Sections (nested by heading) → Block&lt;br&gt;Block = paragraph, table or list; a list over 1,500 characters is split into list items; &lt;b&gt;role&lt;/b&gt; = body / footnote&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Block ID&lt;/b&gt; = document key + heading path + order within section (no # title, no footnote marks, Thai digits → Arabic)&lt;br&gt;Content hash of normalized text; &lt;b&gt;line range per version, on CONTAINS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HAS_VERSION, CONTAINS, NEXT" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="246" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Layer 1: References&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regex + document registry → REFERENCES &lt;b&gt;to the logical Document&lt;/b&gt;, one edge per cited section; stub Documents for laws not in the store&lt;br&gt;rule_version on every edge (now L1-v3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;LLM for ambiguous references: not used yet&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;SUPERSEDES is written at upload (step 8)&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="472" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Layer 2: Block–entity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Types: Concept, Role, Artifact (+ Body, Place)&lt;br&gt;Entity registry from definitions, headings, regulation titles + a reviewed manual file; &lt;b&gt;no NER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MENTIONS &lt;b&gt;Block → Entity&lt;/b&gt;, with &lt;b&gt;values&lt;/b&gt; (number + unit) on the edge&lt;br&gt;Hubs (block share &amp;gt; 0.2) flagged&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;LLM fallback tested, not adopted&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="698" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Layer 3: Merge duplicate entities&lt;/b&gt; (built, L3-v1)&lt;br&gt;Candidates: name containment + e5 name similarity ≥ 0.85 (top 3)&lt;br&gt;Local LLM confirms; code rule: a longer name merges only if it adds generic words&lt;br&gt;merged_into + ALIAS_OF to the canonical entity (reversible)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Pilot: 180 pairs, 0 merges (no Thai–English overlap)&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="924" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Layer 4: DEPENDS&lt;/b&gt; (built, L4-v1)&lt;br&gt;Most central 20% of blocks (variant B); pairs: shared entity + 5 nearest by e5, ≤ 5 per block&lt;br&gt;Local LLM; edge only if quotes are found in both blocks&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Pilot: 490 pairs → 15 edges, quality mixed; guide is a draft&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="1150" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" parent="L1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Store (Neo4j)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nodes + relationships with provenance, rule_version and valid_from/to&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vector index&lt;/b&gt; on Block (e5); full-text index &lt;i&gt;not yet&lt;/i&gt; (character trigrams in Python)&lt;br&gt;1 document = 1 transaction&lt;br&gt;LLM cache (hash, prompt, model) in SQLite; local Qwen3.5-4B (OpenRouter optional)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="200" x="1376" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reg" parent="L1" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Document registry + entity registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Documents: front matter, file names, titles, reviewed aliases. Entities: definitions (X หมายความว่า), headings, regulation subjects, manual file (source, added_by, added_on; never from label sheets)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="560" x="330" y="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="variants" parent="L1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Experiment variants&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;A = layers 0–2: built and measured&lt;br&gt;B = A + layer 3 + layer 4 on the top 20% central blocks: built, &lt;b&gt;same result as A on the pilot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C = all layers on every block: not run (about 2 h locally)&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="456" x="1110" y="258" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s2" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s3" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s5" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s6" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" edge="1" parent="1" source="s6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="s7" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;endArrow=open;" target="s1" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;endArrow=open;" target="s3" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;endArrow=open;" target="s4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;endArrow=open;" target="s5" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L2" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="Example of the resulting graph (annual leave case)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="1590" x="60" y="475" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle height="30" width="390" x="60" y="475" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ldoc" parent="L2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Document (logical)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HR Policy" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="200" x="40" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ver" parent="L2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Version&lt;/b&gt; v3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="140" x="70" y="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A12" parent="L2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Block A-12&lt;/b&gt; (HR Policy v3, lines 40–41)&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;Annual leave is 10 days a year.&amp;quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="240" x="25" y="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C03" parent="L2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Block C-03&lt;/b&gt; (Onboarding guide)&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;For leave rules, see the HR Policy.&amp;quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="240" x="390" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="D21" parent="L2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Block D-21&lt;/b&gt; (Budget guide)&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;Leave budget = headcount × annual leave days&amp;quot;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="240" x="390" y="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="al1" parent="L2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Alias&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Annual leave" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="150" x="730" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="al2" parent="L2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Alias&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;วันลาพักร้อน" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="150" x="730" y="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ent" parent="L2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Entity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Annual leave entitlement" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="210" x="960" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B07" parent="L2" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;Block B-07&lt;/b&gt; (Staff FAQ, in Thai)&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;พนักงานลาพักร้อนได้ 10 วัน&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;(Staff get 10 days of leave)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="250" x="950" y="245" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="expl" parent="L2" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;If leave changes to 12 days (HR Policy v4 edits A-12)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;C-03&lt;/b&gt; cites the document → still found, because REFERENCES points to the logical document, not v3&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;B-07&lt;/b&gt; uses the Thai name → found already by its &lt;b&gt;value&lt;/b&gt;: &quot;10 วัน&quot; and &quot;10 days&quot; are the same value on MENTIONS; via the same Entity only after the Thai–English merge (layer 3, not built yet)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;D-21&lt;/b&gt; never mentions &quot;10&quot; → found mainly via DEPENDS (not built yet)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;A shared entity or value only produces candidates; the decision is made in step 13. Hub entities are left out (cut-off 0.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="340" x="1230" y="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e15" edge="1" parent="L2" source="A12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="ent" value="MENTIONS (layer 2)&lt;br&gt;Block → Entity">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.0009" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="265" y="250" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e11" edge="1" parent="1" source="ldoc" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="ver" value="HAS_VERSION">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e12" edge="1" parent="1" source="ver" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="A12" value="CONTAINS">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e13" edge="1" parent="1" source="C03" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" target="ldoc" value="REFERENCES (layer 1)&lt;br&gt;to the logical document">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e14" edge="1" parent="1" source="D21" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;" target="A12" value="DEPENDS (layer 4)&lt;br&gt;+ evidence text">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e16" edge="1" parent="1" source="D21" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;" target="ent" value="MENTIONS">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e17" edge="1" parent="1" source="B07" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=1;" target="ent" value="MENTIONS (after the&lt;br&gt;Thai–English merge)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e18" edge="1" parent="1" source="al1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="ent" value="ALIAS_OF (layer 3)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.3118" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e19" edge="1" parent="1" source="al2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.35;entryY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="ent" value="ALIAS_OF">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="865" y="690" />
              <mxPoint x="1094.9" y="690" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L3" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="Part 2: Use the graph when a new document version is uploaded (impact analysis)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="275" width="1590" x="60" y="845" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u1" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Upload and identify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Which document: registry key → text similarity → a person confirms&lt;br&gt;Split into blocks with layer 0&lt;br&gt;New Version &lt;b&gt;SUPERSEDES&lt;/b&gt; the previous one (valid_to set); title updated; &lt;b&gt;unchanged blocks reuse their node&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="15" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Match blocks and diff&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1: same hash = unchanged&lt;br&gt;2: similar text, same section (renamed headings followed) = &lt;b&gt;edited&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2b: very similar, other section = &lt;b&gt;edited&lt;/b&gt; (moved)&lt;br&gt;3: removed block found in another uploaded file = &lt;b&gt;moved&lt;/b&gt;, may split into up to 3 blocks&lt;br&gt;Footnotes: exact text only&lt;br&gt;Rest = &lt;b&gt;removed&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;added&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stored:&lt;/b&gt; diff status + previous block on CONTAINS; removed blocks on the Version" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="212" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u3" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;10. Light update&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Layers 1–2 and embeddings on the current versions (a rerun changes nothing)&lt;br&gt;So new blocks have REFERENCES, MENTIONS and vectors before searching" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="409" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u4" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;11. Find candidates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Graph signals (valid edges only): broken reference (rule); cites the changed section; DEPENDS; old value of a changed attribute; shared entity (canonical); cites the whole document&lt;br&gt;+ hybrid search (trigrams + e5)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hub entities left out&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="606" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u5" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;12. Rank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Graph-first&lt;/b&gt;: blocks the graph reaches, strongest signal first, then hybrid order (chosen over RRF on the labels)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Production:&lt;/b&gt; cut by score threshold&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Experiment:&lt;/b&gt; top N equal to the baseline" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="803" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u6" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;13. LLM check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Input: &lt;b&gt;old text + new text&lt;/b&gt; + candidate block&lt;br&gt;Output: needs update / not affected / unsure + reason + evidence quoted from the candidate&lt;br&gt;Local Qwen3.5-4B, top 10 per change; &lt;b&gt;labels, never filters&lt;/b&gt; (as a filter recall fell 0.90 → 0.42)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="1000" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u7" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;14. Report and human review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CSV (&lt;i&gt;kg impact&lt;/i&gt;) + review sheet (&lt;i&gt;--review&lt;/i&gt;): flagged changes, top 10, system judgement shown&lt;br&gt;A person fills needs_update / review_only / not_affected → &lt;i&gt;kg review-import&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Not built: filter by access rights&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="1197" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u8" parent="L3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;15. Full update&lt;/b&gt; (built)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;kg full-update&lt;/i&gt;: edges of blocks no longer current get valid_to (not deleted)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;kg review-apply&lt;/i&gt;: rejected items lower edge confidence (× 0.5)&lt;br&gt;Layer 3, and layer 4 for new / edited blocks (&lt;i&gt;kg ingest&lt;/i&gt;)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="180" x="1394" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" parent="L3" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=2;" value="Known weakness: a dependency not created as an edge cannot be found by traversal in step 11, so hybrid search must always run alongside it." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="35" width="1000" x="15" y="228" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
