        <mxCell id="L4" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="Part 3: Other uses of the same graph" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="1590" x="60" y="1140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o1" parent="L4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Question answering (graph-guided retrieval)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hybrid search finds seed blocks → expand via MENTIONS / REFERENCES → LLM answers with block-level citations" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="490" x="20" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o2" parent="L4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Browse relationships in the store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Which documents cite this one / where this entity appears / which version replaced which (Cypher queries)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="490" x="540" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o3" parent="L4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Check store quality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;References to documents missing from the store; blocks that state conflicting values for the same entity" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="490" x="1060" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L5" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="Part 4: Evaluation (run alongside the build)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="1590" x="60" y="1305" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ev1" parent="L5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Gold edge labels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blind sheets for a person (&lt;i&gt;_human&lt;/i&gt;); AI answers kept apart (&lt;i&gt;_ai&lt;/i&gt;) and never count for &quot;done&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;No person has labelled yet&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;DEPENDS is rare; may need more labels" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="20" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ev2" parent="L5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Change test set&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;40 real + 15 synthetic edit items; candidates pooled from 5 methods + additions; needs_review / needs_revision&lt;br&gt;Historical blocks (amending acts, reason notes) reported apart" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="410" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ev3" parent="L5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Per-layer metrics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Precision / recall of REFERENCES, MENTIONS (blind sheet ready), DEPENDS (separately)&lt;br&gt;Entity merge error rate, run-to-run stability (Jaccard)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="800" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ev4" parent="L5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Main experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Baseline (hybrid) vs A vs B at the same N, AI labels: recall@5 0.28 → 0.66 → 0.66 (layers 3–4 add nothing on the pilot); C not run&lt;br&gt;Split by 3 passage kinds + tokens per file" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="1190" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e29" edge="1" parent="1" source="ev1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="ev3" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e30" edge="1" parent="1" source="ev2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" target="ev4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e31" edge="1" parent="1" source="ev3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="ev4" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e32" edge="1" parent="1" source="u7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.75;entryY=0;" target="ev2" value="approvals / rejections become labels">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="L6" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="Part 5: What to test before building, and requirements for real use" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="1590" x="60" y="1485" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sp1" parent="L6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Test 1: Block ID stability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 documents with two real versions → parse and match → count % matched correctly&lt;br&gt;If low, fix layer 0 first; every layer depends on it" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="20" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sp2" parent="L6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Test 2: Thai&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thai NER: not needed (registry rules instead)&lt;br&gt;Neo4j Thai full-text analyzer: exists, not used yet&lt;br&gt;Measure OCR files and born-digital files separately" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="410" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sp3" parent="L6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Test 3: Entity distribution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Count how many blocks the most frequent entities appear in&lt;br&gt;Use it to set the hub cut-off: &lt;i&gt;done, 0.2&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="800" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops" parent="L6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacing=5;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Requirements for real use&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Access rights stored on Document and applied to every query (not yet applied)&lt;br&gt;• Re-extraction policy when the prompt or model changes (rule_version, prompt_version)&lt;br&gt;• Scheduled dumps (Community has no online backup)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="365" x="1190" y="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgt" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="80" x="60" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="No LLM" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="150" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="LLM partly / fallback only" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="350" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="LLM-heavy (candidate pairs only)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="550" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="Storage / human review" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="750" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="entity / alias" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="950" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="Test before building" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="190" x="1150" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="Dashed grey = read/write graph, registry or labels" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="300" x="1360" y="1662" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KG" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=30;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="What the knowledge graph contains (stored in Neo4j)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1670" width="640" x="1690" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KGn" parent="KG" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;overflow=fill;" value="&lt;b&gt;Nodes (6 types)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#eeeeee;&quot;&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;What it is&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Document&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The logical document, independent of version; holds the document key and access rights&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;One version of a document (one uploaded file)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Section&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;A heading in the Markdown; each version has a root Section and headings nest below it&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;A paragraph, table, list or list item; role body / footnote; Block ID, content hash, e5 embedding (vector index). The line range is kept per version on CONTAINS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alias&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;A name as matched (Thai, English, abbreviation); one Entity per Alias&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Entity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;What the names refer to: Concept, Role, Artifact, Body, Place (laws are Documents; values sit on MENTIONS); hub flag&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="275" width="600" x="20" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KGr" parent="KG" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;overflow=fill;" value="&lt;b&gt;Relationships (8 types)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#eeeeee;&quot;&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Meaning&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Created by&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;HAS_VERSION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Document → Version&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Document identification step&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;CONTAINS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Version → root Section → Section → Block (block ID, line range and order per version; diff status and previous block after an upload)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Parser&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;NEXT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;The next block in the same version&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Parser&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#d5e8d4;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;SUPERSEDES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;New Version → previous Version&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Upload step (metadata)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#dae8fc;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;REFERENCES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Block → logical Document (cited section stored as a property)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Regex + document registry (LLM for ambiguous cases: not yet)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#dae8fc;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;MENTIONS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Block → Entity (name as matched in evidence_span; values: number + unit)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Entity registry rules; LLM fallback tested, not adopted&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#dae8fc;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;ALIAS_OF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Alias → Entity (reversible)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Registry; layer 3: e5 name similarity + local LLM + rule checks (L3-v1)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;background:#ffe6cc;&quot;&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEPENDS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Block → the Block whose fact it uses without citing it&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;LLM on candidate pairs only; quotes found in both blocks (L4-v1)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='font-size:11px'&gt;Row colours match the legend: green = no LLM, blue = LLM partly, orange = LLM-heavy&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="500" width="600" x="20" y="325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KGph" parent="KG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Data on every relationship&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Provenance:&lt;/b&gt; evidence_block, evidence_span, method, model, prompt_version, confidence&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;rule_version:&lt;/b&gt; a rerun with newer rules closes the older edges&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Validity period:&lt;/b&gt; valid_from, valid_to — when a document changes, old relationships are closed, not deleted&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Human review result:&lt;/b&gt; review_status (approved / rejected), used to adjust confidence" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="600" x="20" y="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KGbh" parent="KG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Identifying and matching blocks across versions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Block ID&lt;/b&gt; = document key + heading path + order within section (where the block is)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Node key&lt;/b&gt; is set when a block is first seen; a block the diff finds unchanged keeps its node even if it moved&lt;br&gt;• Match: 1 hash, 2 similar text in the same section, 2b another section, 3 another document; footnotes exact only&lt;br&gt;• Unchanged blocks keep their node and relationships; no re-extraction" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="600" x="20" y="1034" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
